        "id": "uther",
        "name": "Uther"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Li Li does very well with Heroes who can mitigate burst damage on their own because it allows her to succeed against burst damage, where she otherwise struggles. That said, this is not a concern when facing team compositions that lack burst damage altogether.\n\nWhile not really a synergy, Li Li also does well with Heroes who have strong waveclear as she is not able to directly contribute to macro pressure in a meaningful way.\n\nLast but not the least, Li Li does not have access to hard crowd control effects, therefore she will perform way better when paired with Heroes who can provide it.\n\nConsidering how her Abilities and Talents work, Li Li is pretty interesting to play together with a burst Healer, but make sure to still have a well-rounded team composition when doing so."
  },
