    {
      "name": "Healing Brew Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Li Li's Healing Brew Build is designed to provide Blinds more often and for slightly longer, something that helps against Heroes who rely a lot on Basic Attacks for dealing damage, healing, and/or getting cooldown reduction (Illidan comes to mind).\n\nTwo For One at Level 16 helps you keep multiple allied Heroes in a good shape with the help of Free Drinks at Level 1. Surging Winds at Level 4 increases your healing output.\n\nSurging Winds at Level 4 slightly reduces Blinding Wind's cooldown and Gale Force at Level 13 makes the Blind last a bit longer.",
