    {
      "name": "Cloud Serpent Build",
      "label": "Advanced",
      "description": "Li Li's Cloud Serpent Build turns you into a battle Healer who can provide a fair amount of healing and deal a decent amount of damage at the same time, a combination that is particularly suited for drawn-out team fights.\n\nThe combination of Wind Serpent at Level 4 and Lightning Serpent at Level 13 allows her to constantly pressure the enemy team with low but steady damage, especially if you can get value from Fast Feet for Serpent Sidekick at Level 1.\n\nWhile good on its own, this Build works better when playing Li Li together with another Healer as it increases your damage (as explained already) and their healing, thanks to Blessings Of Yu'lon at Level 16.",
